---
import ContentPage from '../components/ContentPage.astro';
const title = 'About GradeWise';
const description = 'An independent project making grade calculations clearer and less stressful for students.';
---

<ContentPage title={title} description={description} eyebrow="A SMALL, INDEPENDENT PROJECT">
  <h2>Why I built GradeWise</h2>
  <p>GradeWise is an independent project built by one developer with limited resources. I started it because figuring out grades can be confusing, especially when course weights, final exams, and different grading rules all come into play.</p>
  <p>The goal is simple: make useful, accessible tools that help students everywhere understand the numbers and plan their next steps with a little less stress.</p>
  <p>I build and improve GradeWise carefully over time. The calculator is meant to make the math clearer, not to replace a conversation with an instructor or the rules in a course syllabus.</p>
  <p>If you notice something unclear or have an idea that could make the tools more useful, <a href="/contact/">share feedback</a>.</p>
</ContentPage>
